 Update 2017</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20190212131216&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Temple_Teleport_Scroll_3d99b0.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a temple teleport scroll.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.20 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">This item cannot be traded.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>When used, the temple teleport scroll will send the character immediately to their home temple. A temple teleport scroll cannot be used in No-Logout Zones or if the character has a Logout Block or Protection Zone Block.\n</p><p>The scroll can be taken from the Daily Reward System and expires after 7 days or after use.\n</p><p>You can also buy a one-time use <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple%20Teleport\">Temple Teleport</a> on the Store for 15 <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Tibia Coins\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"12\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tibia_Coins_Small_f363f5.gif\" width=\"12\"/></span> Tibia Coins.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headl